
=== Operating point =======================================================
Vin 11.40 V  Iin 5.56 A  D 0.452  dI 2.34 App  Ipk 6.73 A
Vin 12.00 V  Iin 5.28 A  D 0.420  dI 2.29 App  Ipk 6.42 A
Vin 12.60 V  Iin 5.03 A  D 0.389  dI 2.23 App  Ipk 6.14 A
Pout 57.0 W; CCM/DCM boundary at Iout = 0.66 A (standby runs DCM, fine)

=== Inductor ==============================================================
L = 22 uH, ripple 43 % of Iin at 12 V
needs Isat >= 8.7 A (Ipk 6.73 A x 1.3), Irms 5.60 A
stored energy at Isat: 0.84 mJ  -> powdered iron (-26/-52 mix) or gapped core, NOT plain ferrite
copper for 5 A/mm2: 1.12 mm2; skin depth 0.21 mm -> 3 strands of 0.6-0.7 mm in parallel (or 2 x 0.9 mm)
   if AL =  33 nH/N^2 -> 25.8 turns
   if AL =  46 nH/N^2 -> 21.9 turns
   if AL =  60 nH/N^2 -> 19.1 turns
   if AL =  75 nH/N^2 -> 17.1 turns
   if AL =  93 nH/N^2 -> 15.4 turns

=== MOSFET (STP36NF06, 60 V / 36 A / 40 mOhm) =============================
Vds stress 19.9 V + ringing (60 V part: 3x margin)
Irms 3.74 A  Pcond 0.84 W  Psw 0.22 W  -> 1.06 W; gate drive 30 mW

=== Diode (BYW29-100, 8 A / 100 V ultrafast) ==============================
Iavg 3.0 A, Ipk 6.7 A, Vr 19 V -> Pd 2.55 W -> TO-220 heatsink required

=== Current sense / limit =================================================
R_shunt 50 mOhm  P 0.70 W
divider 1.00k/1.00k: trip at 8.0 A peak (nominal Ipk 6.4 A, worst 6.7 A)

=== Output capacitor ======================================================
3 x 1 mF: ripple current 2.72 A total, 0.91 A each
ripple: 4.5 mV (charge) + 135 mV (ESR 20 mOhm) = 0.73 % of Vout

=== Input capacitor =======================================================
ripple current 0.66 A rms -> 2 x 1000 uF / 50 V (0.3 A each)

=== Loss budget ===========================================================
   diode      2.55 W
   mosfet     1.06 W
   shunt      0.70 W
   inductor   1.03 W
   caps       0.15 W
   control    0.21 W
total 5.69 W -> efficiency 90.9 % (assumed 90 %)

=== Oscillator (SG3524: f = 1.30 / (RT CT)) ===============================
CT 3.3 nF -> RT 3939 Ohm -> 3.92 kOhm gives 100 kHz (+-10 %, trim not needed)

=== Feedback divider ======================================================
   Vref 4.6 V: trimmer sets Vout 15.82 .. 19.30 V  (reaches 19 V)
   Vref 5.0 V: trimmer sets Vout 17.19 .. 20.98 V  (reaches 19 V)
   Vref 5.4 V: trimmer sets Vout 18.57 .. 22.66 V  (reaches 19 V)
   trimmer centred: Vout 19.09 V

=== Over-voltage shutdown (SG3524 pin 10) =================================
BZX79C22 + 1k into SD, 4.75k to GND: trips at ~22.8 V (21.7..23.9 V over zener tolerance); 1.5KE24A TVS backs it up

=== Compensation (type III) ===============================================
EA stays linear for output disturbances up to ~1.05 V (200 uA x R3)
fz1 = 260 Hz, fz2 = 229 Hz, fp1 = 9.2 kHz, fp2 = 12.2 kHz
